{"text":"kuruntokai","n":377,"lines":["மலரேர் உண்கண் மாணலந் தொலைய","வளையேர் மென்றோள் ஞெகிழ்ந்ததன் தலையும்","மாற்றா கின்றே தோழியாற் றலையே","அறிதற் கமையா நாடனொடு","செய்து கொண்டதோர் சிறுநன் னட்பே"],"tr":["malarēr uṇkaṇ māṇalan tolaiya","vaḷaiyēr meṉṟōḷ ñekiḻntataṉ talaiyum","māṟṟā kiṉṟē tōḻiyāṟ ṟalaiyē","aṟitaṟ kamaiyā nāṭaṉoṭu","ceytu koṇṭatōr ciṟunaṉ ṉaṭpē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"மோசி கொற்றனார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Mōci Koṟṟaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 18, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 13, veṇṭaḷai 5"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"மலரேர்","tr":"malarēr","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மல","tr":"mala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரேர்","tr":"rēr"}]},{"text":"உண்கண்","tr":"uṇkaṇ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"உண்","tr":"uṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"}]},{"text":"மாணலந்","tr":"māṇalan","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணலந்","tr":"ṇalan"}]},{"text":"தொலைய","tr":"tolaiya","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தொலை","tr":"tolai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ய","tr":"ya"}]}],[{"text":"வளையேர்","tr":"vaḷaiyēr","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வளை","tr":"vaḷai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யேர்","tr":"yēr"}]},{"text":"மென்றோள்","tr":"meṉṟōḷ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மென்","tr":"meṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றோள்","tr":"ṟōḷ"}]},{"text":"ஞெகிழ்ந்ததன்","tr":"ñekiḻntataṉ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ஞெகிழ்ந்","tr":"ñekiḻn"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ததன்","tr":"tataṉ"}]},{"text":"தலையும்","tr":"talaiyum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலை","tr":"talai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]}],[{"text":"மாற்றா","tr":"māṟṟā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மாற்","tr":"māṟ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றா","tr":"ṟā"}]},{"text":"கின்றே","tr":"kiṉṟē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கின்","tr":"kiṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றே","tr":"ṟē"}]},{"text":"தோழியாற்","tr":"tōḻiyāṟ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ழியாற்","tr":"ḻiyāṟ"}]},{"text":"றலையே","tr":"ṟalaiyē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"றலை","tr":"ṟalai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யே","tr":"yē"}]}],[{"text":"அறிதற்","tr":"aṟitaṟ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அறி","tr":"aṟi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தற்","tr":"taṟ"}]},{"text":"கமையா","tr":"kamaiyā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கமை","tr":"kamai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"}]},{"text":"நாடனொடு","tr":"nāṭaṉoṭu","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டனொ","tr":"ṭaṉo"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டு","tr":"ṭu"}]}],[{"text":"செய்து","tr":"ceytu","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செய்","tr":"cey"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]},{"text":"கொண்டதோர்","tr":"koṇṭatōr","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொண்","tr":"koṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டதோர்","tr":"ṭatōr"}]},{"text":"சிறுநன்","tr":"ciṟunaṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிறு","tr":"ciṟu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நன்","tr":"naṉ"}]},{"text":"னட்பே","tr":"ṉaṭpē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"னட்","tr":"ṉaṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பே","tr":"pē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"மலரேர்","parts":[{"text":"மலர்","lemma":"மலர்","gloss":"flower"},{"text":"ஏர்","lemma":"ஏர்","gloss":"beauty/resemblance"}],"gloss":"flower-like beauty"},{"surface":"உண்கண்","parts":[{"text":"உண்","lemma":"உண்","gloss":"kohl-applied"},{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eye"}],"gloss":"kohl-applied eyes"},{"surface":"மாணலம்","parts":[{"text":"மாண்","lemma":"மாண்","gloss":"great"},{"text":"நலம்","lemma":"நலம்","gloss":"beauty"}],"gloss":"great beauty"},{"surface":"தொலைய","parts":[{"text":"தொலைய","lemma":"தொலை","gloss":"to be lost"}],"gloss":"to be lost"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வளையேர்","parts":[{"text":"வளை","lemma":"வளை","gloss":"bangle"},{"text":"ஏர்","lemma":"ஏர்","gloss":"beauty/resemblance"}],"gloss":"bangle-adorned beauty"},{"surface":"மென்றோள்","parts":[{"text":"மென்றோள்","lemma":"மென்றோள்","gloss":"soft shoulders"}],"gloss":"soft shoulders","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஞெகிழ்ந்ததன்","parts":[{"text":"ஞெகிழ்ந்ததன்","lemma":"ஞெகிழ்ந்ததன்","gloss":"of having thinned"}],"gloss":"of having thinned","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தலையும்","parts":[{"text":"தலை","lemma":"தலை","gloss":"top/moreover"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and/also"}],"gloss":"on top of that"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மாற்றாகின்றே","parts":[{"text":"மாற்றாகின்றே","lemma":"மாற்றாகின்றே","gloss":"becomes changed indeed"}],"gloss":"becomes changed indeed","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend"},{"surface":"ஆற்றலையே","parts":[{"text":"ஆற்றலையே","lemma":"ஆற்றலையே","gloss":"endurance indeed"}],"gloss":"endurance indeed","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அறிதற்கு","parts":[{"text":"அறிதல்","lemma":"அறிதல்","gloss":"knowing"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"for"}],"gloss":"for knowing"},{"surface":"அமையா","parts":[{"text":"அமையா","lemma":"அமை","gloss":"not fitting/difficult"}],"gloss":"difficult"},{"surface":"நாடனொடு","parts":[{"text":"நாடன்","lemma":"நாடன்","gloss":"man of the land"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the man of the land"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"செய்து","parts":[{"text":"செய்து","lemma":"செய்","gloss":"having made"}],"gloss":"having made"},{"surface":"கொண்டதோர்","parts":[{"text":"கொண்டது","lemma":"கொள்","gloss":"taken/possessed"},{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ஓர்","gloss":"one"}],"gloss":"a certain"},{"surface":"சிறுநல்","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"சிறு","gloss":"small"},{"text":"நல்","lemma":"நல்","gloss":"good"}],"gloss":"small, good"},{"surface":"நட்பே","parts":[{"text":"நட்பு","lemma":"நட்பு","gloss":"friendship/love"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"friendship indeed"}]}],"literal":"As the great beauty of my flower-like kohl-applied eyes is lost, / and on top of my soft shoulders adorned with beautiful bangles becoming thin, / it becomes changed indeed, O friend, my endurance indeed, / with the man of the land who is difficult to understand, / the small, good friendship that I made.","translation":"O friend! As the great beauty of my flower-like, kohl-painted eyes fades away, and on top of that, my soft shoulders adorned with beautiful bangles grow thin, my very endurance has failed me. All because of this small, sweet love that I made with the lord of the mountain land, whose mind is so difficult to understand.","modern":"தோழியே! மலர் போன்ற மை தீட்டிய என் கண்களின் சிறந்த அழகு அழியுமாறு, வளையல்கள் அணிந்த மென்மையான என் தோள்கள் மெலிந்து போனதன் மேலே, என் பொறுமையும் அழிந்து போகின்றது. அறிந்துகொள்வதற்கு எளியவன் அல்லாத மலைநாட்டினனோடு நான் செய்து கொண்ட சிறிய, நல்ல நட்பினால் தான் இது நேர்ந்தது.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend in a state of deep distress caused by her separation from the hero. She describes how her physical appearance is deteriorating: the beauty of her flower-like eyes is fading, and her soft shoulders are thinning so much that her bangles are slipping off. On top of these physical changes, she laments that her inner strength and endurance have completely failed. She attributes all this suffering to the 'small, good friendship' she entered into with the lord of the mountain land. She notes that his mind and intentions are difficult to comprehend, reflecting her anxiety over his delay in marrying her. This poem belongs to the Kuriñci tiṇai, where the secret union and the subsequent pain of separation are central themes.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}